id: dimensional-hole
name: Dimensional Hole
advancement: true
prerequisite: 4+ Skill Ranks in Use Magic
tpCost: 10
# A button on a Basic Attack at you with an Energy or Magic Foundation, before it is rolled: 1 Counter Action, the
# Opponent you target its target instead, its Combat Rolls Urgent; once a Combat Encounter (chat.mjs dimensionalHole).
dimensionalHole: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Targeted by an Energy or Magic Basic Attack: 1 Counter Action, and an Opponent you target is its target instead, its
  Combat Rolls Urgent. Once a Combat Encounter.
text: >
  Dimensional Hole: Using a portal to protect yourself from an attack, you redirect that attack against an enemy.
  –Prerequisites: 4+ Skill Ranks in Use Magic
  –TP Cost: 10
  –Effect: If you are targeted by the Basic Attack Maneuver using an Energy or Magic Foundation, you may spend 1 Counter
  Action. If you do, target an Opponent, they become the target of the Attacking Maneuver instead of you. The Combat
  Rolls for that Attacking Maneuver become Urgent.

  You can only use this effect once per Combat Encounter.
